          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"events\":[{\"id\":776,\"name\":\"West London Dub Club - Ital Power meets Entebbe\",\"start_time\":\"2026-08-15T17:00:00Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-08-15T23:59:00Z\",\"poster\":\"8b92cd2e3e35fdf74c26cddadb2c9933.webp\",\"background\":\"\",\"description\":\"West London Dub Club presents Chapter VI:\\nITAL POWER meets ENTEBBE\\nALL TRIBES WELCOME!\\n5PM-12AM\\nSaturday 15th August 2026\\n\\nThe Dominion Centre\\n112 The Green, Southall UB2 4BQ\\n\\nFood - Music - Merchandise\\n\\nItal Power Sound System\\n-Outta West London\\n-M.Ital, Ital Shash, Benji Roots \\u0026 full crew\\n\\nEntebbe Sound System\\n-Outta North London\\n-Rasta Chanters\\n-Ras P, Gad Man \\u0026 Full Crew\\n\\nBoth playing on their own full sound systems\\nStrictly heavyweight business till done!\\n\\nInstagram \\u0026 Facebook - @WestLondonDubClub\\n\\nTravel\\nTube\\nSouthall (Elizabeth Line) 6 Min Walk\\n\\nCar\\nLarge car park next to venue\\n\\nTickets\\nAdvanced starting from £10 + booking fees\\nM.O.T.D (More On The Door)\",\"is_featured\":false,\"poster_small\":\"\",\"is_preview\":false,\"external_url\":\"https://ra.co/events/2492231\",\"is_announced\":true,\"is_on_listings_site\":true,\"resale_queue_enabled\":true,\"is_test_event\":false,\"is_cancelled\":false,\"categories\":[{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"club\"}],\"is_free\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"artists\":[{\"id\":175,\"artist_name\":\"Ital Power \",\"gov_name\":\"\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"bio\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"},{\"id\":1979,\"artist_name\":\"Entebbe\",\"gov_name\":\"\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"bio\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"}],\"venues\":[{\"id\":32,\"name\":\"The Dominion Centre\",\"address\":\"112 The Green\",\"city\":\"London\",\"country\":\"\",\"capacity\":0,\"contact_email\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"wheelchair_accessible\":false,\"accessible_bathrooms\":false,\"hearing_loop\":false,\"accessible_parking\":false,\"lift_access\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"}],\"promoters\":[{\"id\":47,\"name\":\"West London Dub Club\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"stripe_account_id\":\"\",\"ticket_email\":\"\",\"custom_domain\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"}],\"tags\":[{\"id\":4,\"name\":\"dub\"},{\"id\":6,\"name\":\"sound system\"}]},{\"id\":780,\"name\":\"Impulse Control: Lebanon Fundraiser\",\"start_time\":\"2026-08-15T17:00:00Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-08-16T02:00:00Z\",\"poster\":\"13833f9bddf7c52ca47fd4d9097189fe.webp\",\"background\":\"\",\"description\":\"Across two rooms, we're bringing together Lebanese artists alongside friends and supporters from London's underground music scene for a full programme of live performances and DJ sets spanning noise, industrial, experimental electronics, breaks, hardcore, techno, and beyond.\\n\\n100% of proceeds will go towards humanitarian relief efforts in Lebanon.\\n\\nEntry is by donation at the door. We suggest a donation of £10-£15, but please give whatever you can - every contribution makes a difference.\\n\\nFree tickets are available to help us estimate attendance, but are not required. Walk-ins are welcome throughout the day and night, subject to venue capacity. Please note that holding a free ticket does not guarantee entry if the venue is full.\\n\\nARDENT PAIN (live)\\n\\nPainful harsh noise.\\n\\nAVEL MISMO (live)\\n\\nAbstract electronics rooted in Lebanon.\\n\\nAVENTEX\\n\\nDeep, dark beats.\\n\\nBAYTEE BAYTAK\\n\\nBeirut rhythms meet UK bass and breaks.\\n\\nCHORONZON\\n\\nIndustrial excursions and razor-sharp sounds from across the globe.\\n\\nCOCKTAIL PARTY EFFECT\\n\\nBass-heavy mutations and leftfield club sounds.\\n\\niAMA B2B NEW FLESH\\n\\nMulti-genre resident DJs.\\n\\nMAXQUERADE\\n\\nBass-heavy bleeps and broken rhythms.\\n\\nMHAMAD SAFA\\n\\nExperimental electronics from Lebanon driven by intricate percussion.\\n\\nNAKEDAGGRESSIONDJ\\n\\nIndustrial techno at the edge of noise.\\n\\nNK47\\n\\nGenre-defiant club bangers from the Global South.\\n\\nPOWER FAILURE (live)\\n\\nRelentless hardcore with big breakdowns.\\n\\nSLYN (live)\\n\\nSound art via marine biology.\",\"is_featured\":false,\"poster_small\":\"\",\"is_preview\":false,\"external_url\":\"https://ra.co/events/2485829\",\"is_announced\":true,\"is_on_listings_site\":true,\"resale_queue_enabled\":true,\"is_test_event\":false,\"is_cancelled\":false,\"categories\":[{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"club\"},{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"gig\"}],\"is_free\":true,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"artists\":[{\"id\":84,\"artist_name\":\"New Flesh\",\"gov_name\":\"\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"bio\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"},{\"id\":85,\"artist_name\":\"Toni S\",\"gov_name\":\"\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"bio\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"},{\"id\":745,\"artist_name\":\"Slyn\",\"gov_name\":\"\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"bio\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"},{\"id\":1997,\"artist_name\":\"Ardent Pain\",\"gov_name\":\"\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"bio\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"},{\"id\":1998,\"artist_name\":\"Avel Mismo\",\"gov_name\":\"\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"bio\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"},{\"id\":1999,\"artist_name\":\"Aventex\",\"gov_name\":\"\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"bio\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"},{\"id\":2000,\"artist_name\":\"Baytee Baytak\",\"gov_name\":\"\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"bio\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"},{\"id\":2001,\"artist_name\":\"Choronzon\",\"gov_name\":\"\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"bio\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"},{\"id\":2002,\"artist_name\":\"Cocktail Party Effect\",\"gov_name\":\"\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"bio\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"},{\"id\":2003,\"artist_name\":\"MaxQuerade\",\"gov_name\":\"\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"bio\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"},{\"id\":2004,\"artist_name\":\"Mhamad Safa\",\"gov_name\":\"\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"bio\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"},{\"id\":2005,\"artist_name\":\"NakedAggressionDJ\",\"gov_name\":\"\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"bio\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"},{\"id\":2006,\"artist_name\":\"NK47\",\"gov_name\":\"\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"bio\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"},{\"id\":2007,\"artist_name\":\"Power Failure\",\"gov_name\":\"\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"bio\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"}],\"venues\":[{\"id\":48,\"name\":\"AAJA\",\"address\":\"Comet Place\",\"city\":\"London\",\"country\":\"\",\"capacity\":0,\"contact_email\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"wheelchair_accessible\":false,\"accessible_bathrooms\":false,\"hearing_loop\":false,\"accessible_parking\":false,\"lift_access\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"}],\"promoters\":[{\"id\":21,\"name\":\"Impulse Control\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"stripe_account_id\":\"\",\"ticket_email\":\"\",\"custom_domain\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"}],\"tags\":[{\"id\":8,\"name\":\"experimental\"},{\"id\":10,\"name\":\"techno\"},{\"id\":35,\"name\":\"industrial\"},{\"id\":37,\"name\":\"noise\"},{\"id\":55,\"name\":\"breaks\"},{\"id\":68,\"name\":\"hardcore\"}]},{\"id\":697,\"name\":\"Barzakh برزخ - Fundraiser for Lebanon\",\"start_time\":\"2026-08-15T18:30:00Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-08-16T02:00:00Z\",\"poster\":\"55694822047f5e2c94bfdd7c46a96aad.webp\",\"background\":\"\",\"description\":\"Barzakh برزخ - Fundraiser for Lebanon: an evening of music and artist solidarity\\n\\nBarzakh is a café-library and cultural space in Hamra, one of Beirut's most loved neighbourhoods - and a place where many people displaced from southern Lebanon and Beirut's southern suburbs have recently taken refuge. \\n\\nWhen the war on Lebanon escalated at the end of September 2024, Barzakh transformed into a community kitchen, and its work remains as vital as ever amid the ongoing Israeli bombardment and occupation. Barzakh's small team works around the clock to distribute around 2,000 hot meals a day to people who have fled their homes, alongside other urgent community needs like medicine and cash support. Running the kitchen costs up to $1,000 a day.\\n\\nJoin us on 15 August at Jam in a Jar, Harringay, for a summer evening of artistic and musical solidarity, raising money to help Barzakh continue this crucial work.\\n\\nExpect:\\n\\n--- Art workshop and games led by Bosla Arts, a platform sharing the work and stories of artists worldwide facing grave challenges to their artistic freedom of expression.\\n\\n--- Live music by Bassel Hariri, a Syrian violinist from Aleppo who has dedicated his music career to exploring different avenues of expressing the sound of the Arab violin.\\n\\n--- Lebanese songs by Sura, a singer-songwriter originally from Lebanon and now based in London, whose music is shaped by both places. After training in opera in Lebanon, she found herself returning to Arabic music after moving to the UK. Her songs draw on the sounds she grew up with, exploring love, nostalgia and belonging.\\n\\n--- DJ set by Riwa, a poet, theatre-maker, sound designer, and puppeteer working in both creative and backstage capacities. Her art puts people and our relationships at the centre of the political narratives we inhabit, with recent explorations including the unpacking of generational baggage and the politics of pop princesses.\\n\\n--- Music from around the world on cassette, chosen by Sha3by Chic of London DJ collective Koshari.\\n\\n--- More TBC!\",\"is_featured\":false,\"poster_small\":\"\",\"is_preview\":false,\"external_url\":\"\",\"is_announced\":true,\"is_on_listings_site\":true,\"resale_queue_enabled\":true,\"is_test_event\":false,\"is_cancelled\":false,\"categories\":[{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"club\"},{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"gig\"}],\"is_free\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"venues\":[{\"id\":201,\"name\":\"Jam in a Jar\",\"address\":\"599-601 Green Lanes\",\"city\":\"London\",\"country\":\"\",\"capacity\":0,\"contact_email\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"wheelchair_accessible\":false,\"accessible_bathrooms\":false,\"hearing_loop\":false,\"accessible_parking\":false,\"lift_access\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"}],\"promoters\":[{\"id\":333,\"name\":\"Lizzy Galliver\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"stripe_account_id\":\"\",\"ticket_email\":\"\",\"custom_domain\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"