3ce3a551c90ac2d83476f6e6d964f420.webp\",\"background\":\"\",\"description\":\"Monthly Queer Heels Class by Sula Castle\\n\\nOpen to All - No heels experience required !!\\n\\nAUGUST 30th 4-6pm \\n\\nClass Structure will be a mix of walking, improv and set tasks, and a cute routine at the end x will be chill and fun - not scary x i promise x\\n\\nAny questions or if financial barriers are an issue, DM @toughboysdanceco\",\"is_featured\":false,\"poster_small\":\"\",\"is_preview\":false,\"external_url\":\"\",\"is_announced\":true,\"is_on_listings_site\":true,\"resale_queue_enabled\":true,\"is_test_event\":false,\"is_cancelled\":false,\"categories\":[{\"id\":9,\"name\":\"workshop\"}],\"is_free\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"artists\":[{\"id\":1970,\"artist_name\":\"Sula Castle\",\"gov_name\":\"\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"bio\":\"Sula is a London based choreographer, and co-founder of Tough Boys Dance Collective\\n\\nInstagram: @sulacastle @toughboysdanceco\\n\\n\",\"image\":\"99d246f40b45a567b54cce19e65fead1.webp\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"}],\"venues\":[{\"id\":236,\"name\":\"Create Destroy Studios, Islington - 161 Marlborough Road #Floor 3 London N16 4NF\",\"address\":\"\",\"capacity\":0,\"contact_email\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"wheelchair_accessible\":false,\"accessible_bathrooms\":false,\"hearing_loop\":false,\"accessible_parking\":false,\"lift_access\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"}],\"promoters\":[{\"id\":398,\"name\":\"Tough Boys \",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"stripe_account_id\":\"\",\"ticket_email\":\"\",\"custom_domain\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"}],\"ticket_tiers\":[{\"id\":773,\"name\":\"Early Bird\",\"description\":\"10 Early Bird Tickets Available \",\"price\":9,\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"quantity_available\":10,\"quantity_sold\":1,\"resale_listed_count\":0,\"hidden\":false,\"password_protected\":false,\"is_pwyc\":false,\"is_free\":false,\"resale_enabled\":false,\"resale_when_event_sold_out\":false,\"sort_order\":0,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"},{\"id\":774,\"name\":\"General Admission\",\"description\":\"General Admission\",\"price\":11,\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"quantity_available\":15,\"quantity_sold\":0,\"resale_listed_count\":0,\"hidden\":false,\"password_protected\":false,\"is_pwyc\":false,\"is_free\":false,\"resale_enabled\":true,\"resale_when_event_sold_out\":true,\"sort_order\":1,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"}],\"tags\":[{\"id\":252,\"name\":\"dance\"},{\"id\":394,\"name\":\"queer nightlife\"},{\"id\":612,\"name\":\"queerheels\"}]},{\"id\":879,\"name\":\"Pre-launch • Ambient Sauna | Danniella Dee\",\"start_time\":\"2026-08-30T16:00:00Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-08-30T20:30:00Z\",\"poster\":\"8334b6687d1064400f19a8ba1d823006.webp\",\"background\":\"\",\"description\":\"Pre-launch • Join us for the first weekend in our new venue, just two doors down from the original space you know and love! With the main launch party on Monday 31st, come down early for an exclusive preview and be the first to try out the new setup.\\n\\nFor our Sunday pre-launch matinee, we’re excited to welcome Coventry-born and based artist, selector and producer Danniella Dee for an extended dub \\u0026 reggae session. From singing as a chorister beneath Coventry Cathedral’s vaults to touring as her dad’s roadie with The Specials, she grew up between the worlds of sacred, strict rehearsals and bass-rattling rebellion. Today, alongside writing and producing her own music, she hosts The Baddis Sound on NTS Radio, exploring a deep love of reggae and the stories woven through it.\\n\\n*Book your 70-minute sauna session, arrive early and stay late for 4 hours of music in the lounge*\\n\\nABOUT AMBIENT SAUNA\\nOur silent Treehouse sauna and the chatty Herbal sauna are both equipped with a sound system for deep listening. Our Bunker sauna, the Tea Loft listening lounge and yard offer a social setting, perfect for a catch up and meeting new friends.\\n\\nABOUT SAUNA SOCIAL CLUB\\nThe Sauna Social Club is London's first dedicated sauna and ambient listening space. We blend saunas and ice baths with ambient music, making the perfect place to relax and recharge. We've grown out of a need for more healthy spaces to listen to great music. Our goal is to create a space that's designed for comfort and wellbeing that doesn't centre around consumption.\",\"is_featured\":false,\"poster_small\":\"\",\"is_preview\":false,\"external_url\":\"https://tr.ee/8hAwJm9s-B\",\"is_announced\":true,\"is_on_listings_site\":true,\"resale_queue_enabled\":false,\"is_test_event\":false,\"is_cancelled\":false,\"categories\":[{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"club\"},{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"gig\"}],\"is_free\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"artists\":[{\"id\":2278,\"artist_name\":\"Danniella Dee\",\"gov_name\":\"\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"bio\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"}],\"venues\":[{\"id\":31,\"name\":\"Sauna Social Club\",\"address\":\"Railway Arch 842 Brayards Road\",\"city\":\"London\",\"capacity\":0,\"contact_email\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"wheelchair_accessible\":false,\"accessible_bathrooms\":false,\"hearing_loop\":false,\"accessible_parking\":false,\"lift_access\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"}],\"promoters\":[{\"id\":132,\"name\":\"Sauna Social Club\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"stripe_account_id\":\"\",\"ticket_email\":\"\",\"custom_domain\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"}],\"tags\":[{\"id\":4,\"name\":\"dub\"},{\"id\":5,\"name\":\"reggae\"},{\"id\":14,\"name\":\"ambient\"},{\"id\":42,\"name\":\"sauna\"},{\"id\":94,\"name\":\"listening\"},{\"id\":415,\"name\":\"DJs\"}]},{\"id\":545,\"name\":\"Fran \\u0026 Flora present a night of contemporary Yiddish music, feat. Merlin \\u0026 Polina Shepherd, Ilana Cravitz String Band and Fran \\u0026 Flora\",\"start_time\":\"2026-08-30T19:15:00Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-08-30T23:00:00Z\",\"poster\":\"2e77bc561f41b4c089bd3ef65f5a2767.webp\",\"background\":\"\",\"description\":\"Experimental-folk duo Fran \\u0026 Flora curate a special night at The Horse Hospital celebrating contemporary Yiddish culture, showcasing some of the UK’s most acclaimed klezmer artists.\\n\\nFran \\u0026 Flora present brand new material from their upcoming third album; Klezmer clarinet and piano-vocal duo Merlin \\u0026 Polina Shepherd perform a selection of original compositions; fiddler Ilana Cravitz + string band share a first public outing of selected tunes from Beregovsky's recently uncovered Tish Nign collection.\\n\\nABOUT THE ARTISTS\\n\\nFRAN \\u0026 FLORA\\n“time-travels brilliantly between solid folk origins and avant garde play with a surprise at every corner\\\" - Jude Rogers, The Guardian\\n\\nFran \\u0026 Flora's critically acclaimed releases and performances have led to their rise in prominence across folk and avant-garde musical landscapes alike. As leading women of their generation their sophomore album Precious Collection (Hidden Notes Records'24) was The Guardian’s ‘Top 10 Best Folk Albums of the Year’. Presenting uniquely reworked Yiddish music (collected from archival recordings \\u0026 manuscripts) and original compositions for strings, electronics and voice they create an unrivalled evocative and 'border-defying' (Mojo) aesthetic.\\nFar from recreating music from a bygone era their intricately sculpted contemporary sound remains 'as experimental as it is accessible' (The Guardian). Fran \\u0026 Flora perform and teach at festivals globally. \\n\\nMERLIN \\u0026 POLINA SHEPHERD\\n\\\"the Led Zeppelin of contemporary Yiddish music.\\\" – Seth Rogovoy, author, 'The Essential Klezmer'\\n\\nMerlin \\u0026 Polina Shepherd Duo (clarinets, voice, piano) perform together in a way that is rarely encountered. They play music from several linked cultures with improvisation, freedom and spontaneity. The Duo’s playful approach to their root traditions – klezmer, Slavic, East European and southern Medite­rranean – is full of knowledge and deference. It creates a unique sound that embraces the e­nduring spirit of folklore and takes the listener to new dimensions.\\n\\nThey have been performing as a duo since 2004. Apart from their own concerts, they collaborate internationally with performers of various disciplines: a baroque orchestra, a punk band, contemporary dancers, DJs, and theatre productions.\\n\\nILANA CRAVITZ is one of the world’s best-known klezmer fiddlers and is also in demand as a producer, editor, and Yiddish dance leader. Based in London, Ilana tours internationally and regularly helps to set up and run Yiddish culture festivals. She has introduced thousands of people to klezmer through her performances and teaching. Ilana was a co-founder of the London Klezmer Quartet and her book ‘Klezmer Fiddle – A How-To Guide’, is published by Oxford University Press.\\nIlana Cravitz’ Tish Nigumim String Band play a hand-picked selection of tunes from ‘Jewish Songs Without Words’ - an anthology of 215 tunes collected by Moshe Beregovski (1892-1961) that was prepared for publication in the late 1950s and then kept in the Vernadsky National Library, Kiev.\\nNigunim are tunes without words, composed to be sung, catchy and lift the spirits. \\nBeregovski’s book of nigunim was the fourth of five volumes of Jewish music painstakingly assembled by this dedicated Soviet Jewish ethnomusicologist. Tragically, he did not live to see them published. \\nIlana Cravitz is now working on an English edition of this volume, with its glimpses into a now-lost world.\\n\\n\\nThis event is open to the public, and is the closing event to the Jewish Music Institute’s Yiddish Cultural Weekend. \\nWith support from the JMI.\\n\\nDoors 7:15pm\\nMusic 7:45pm - 10:00pm\\nCurfew 11:00pm\",\"is_featured\":false,\"poster_small\":\"\",\"is_preview\":false,\"external_url\":\"\",\"is_announced\":true,\"is_on_listings_site\":true,\"resale_queue_enabled\":true,\"is_test_event\":false,\"is_cancelled\":false,\"categories\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"gig\"},{\"id\":7,\"name\":\"performance\"}],\"is_free\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"artists\":[{\"id\":1202,\"artist_name\":\"Francesca Ter-Berg\",\"gov_name\":\"\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"bio\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"},{\"id\":1273,\"artist_name\":\"Flora Curzon\",\"gov_name\":\"\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"bio\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"},{\"id\":1274,\"artist_name\":\"Ilana Cravitz\",\"gov_name\":\"\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"bio\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"},{\"id\":1275,\"artist_name\":\"Merlin Shepherd\",\"gov_name\":\"\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"bio\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"},{\"id\":1480,\"artist_name\":\"Fran \\u0026 Flora\",\"gov_name\":\"\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"bio\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"},{\"id\":1890,\"artist_name\":\"Polina Shepherd\",\"gov_name\":\"\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"bio\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"}],\"venues\":[{\"id\":17,\"name\":\"The Horse Hospital\",\"address\":\"Colonnade\",\"city\":\"London\",\"country\":\"\",\"capacity\":0,\"contact_email\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"wheelchair_accessible\":false,\"accessible_bathrooms\":false,\"hearing_loop\":false,\"accessible_parking\":false,\"lift_access\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"}],\"promoters\":[{\"id\":248,\"name\":\"Fran \\u0026 Flora\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"stripe_account_id\":\"\",\"ticket_email\":\"\",\"custom_domain\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"}],\"ticket_tiers\":[{\"id\":446,\"name\":\"Concession\",\"price\":12,\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"quantity_available\":25,\"quantity_sold\":10,\"resale_listed_count\":0,\"hidden\":false,\"password_protected\":false,\"is_pwyc\":false,\"is_free\":false,\"resale_enabled\":true,\"resale_when_event_sold_out\":false,\"sort_order\":0,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"},{\"id\":447,\"name\":\"Regular Price\",\"price\":16,\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"quantity_available\":60,\"quantity_sold\":16,\"resale_listed_count\":0,\"hidden\":false,\"password_protected\":false,\"is_pwyc\":false,\"is_free\":false,\"resale_enabled\":true,\"resale_when_event_sold_out\":false,\"sort_order\":0,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"},{\"id\":448,\"name\":\"Supporter\",\"price\":25,\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"quantity_available\":5,\"quantity_sold\":2,\"resale_listed_count\":0,\"hidden\":false,\"password_protected\":false,\"is_pwyc\":false,\"is_free\":false,\"resale_enabled\":true,\"resale_when_event_sold_out\":false,\"sort_order\":0,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"}],\"tags\":[{\"id\":308,\"name\":\"klezmer\"},{\"id\":327,\"name\":\"contemporary\"},{\"id\":375,\"name\":\"Yiddish Culture Weekend\"},{\"id\":376,\"name\":\"JMI\"},{\"id\":377,\"name\":\"Fran \\u0026 Flora\"},{\"id\":378,\"name\":\"London\"}]},{\"id\":875,\"name\":\"Ambient Launch Party • Marysia Osu, Millie McKee \\u0026 TBA\",\"start_time\":\"2026-08-31T14:00:00Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-08-31T22:30:00Z\",\"poster\":\"b8c0dd9730c246ff97ab8c507cd80687.webp\",\"background\":\"\",\"description\":\"Ambient Launch Party • Join us on Monday 31st August as we open the doors to our new space and celebrate two years of Sauna Social Club. Come early and stay late to fully experience our lovely saunas, large yard with ice baths, café, and Tea Loft listening lounge, with an extended programme of live and DJ performances soundtracking the day. Expect special treats throughout, including snacks and games ⋆˚꩜｡\\n\\n*Book your 70-minute sauna session, arrive early and stay late for 8 hours of music in the lounge*\\n\\nABOUT AMBIENT SAUNA\\nOur silent Treehouse sauna and the chatty Herbal sauna are both equipped with a sound system for deep listening. Our Bunker sauna, the Tea Loft listening lounge and yard offer a social setting, perfect for a catch up and meeting new friends.\\n\\nABOUT SAUNA SOCIAL CLUB\\nThe Sauna Social Club is London's first dedicated sauna and ambient listening space. We blend saunas and ice baths with ambient music, making the perfect place to relax and recharge. We've grown out of a need for more healthy spaces to listen to great music. Our goal is to create a space that's designed for comfort and wellbeing that doesn't centre around consumption.\",\"is_featured\":false,\"poster_small\":\"\",\"is_preview\":false,\"external_url\":\"https://tr.ee/tsn2sCPBT-\",\"is_announced\":true,\"is_on_listings_site\":true,\"resale_queue_enabled\":false,\"is_test_event\":false,\"is_cancelled\":false,\"categories\":[{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"club\"},{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"gig\"}],\"is_free\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"artists\":[{\"id\":907,\"artist_name\":\"Millie Mckee\",\"gov_name\":\"\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"bio\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"},{\"id\":1263,\"artist_name\":\"Marysia Osu\",\"gov_name\":\"\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"bio\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"}],\"venues\":[{\"id\":31,\"name\":\"Sauna Social Club\",\"address\":\"Railway Arch 842 Brayards Road\",\"city\":\"London\",\"capacity\":0,\"contact_email\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"wheelchair_accessible\":false,\"accessible_bathrooms\":false,\"hearing_loop\":false,\"accessible_parking\":false,\"lift_access\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"}],\"promoters\":[{\"id\":132,\"name\":\"Sauna Social Club\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"stripe_account_id\":\"\",\"ticket_email\":\"\",\"custom_domain\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"}],\"tags\":[{\"id\":14,\"name\":\"ambient\"},{\"id\":42,\"name\":\"sauna\"},{\"id\":94,\"name\":\"listening\"},{\"id\":103,\"name\":\"music\"},{\"id\":165,\"name\":\"live music\"},{\"id\":415,\"name\":\"DJs\"}]},{\"id\":820,\"name\":\"Hearing Tests, [Brick], Crapstallion, Second Skin | Real Life Presents - new London hardcore\",\"start_time\":\"2026-09-01T18:00:00Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-09-01T22:30:00Z\",\"poster\":\"26076f9037dab7d897239009f3c5f10d.webp\",\"background\":\"\",\"description\":\"Real Life Presents\\n\\nHearing Tests\\nAnti-fascist hardcore noise\\n\\nBrick\\nMurderous transfeminist hardcore\\n\\nCrapstallion\\nlo-fi hardcore punk with big fuzzy bass\\n\\nSecond Skin\\nNew London stompcore from some familiar faces\\n\\nTuesday 1st September\\nNew Cross Inn, nearest stations New Cross Gate and New Cross\\nDoors 6pm\\n£9\\n14+, u16s with an adult 18+\",\"is_featured\":false,\"poster_small\":\"\",\"is_preview\":false,\"external_url\":\"https://pit.live/events/hearing-tests-1\",\"is_announced\":true,\"is_on_listings_site\":true,\"resale_queue_enabled\":true,\"is_test_event\":false,\"is_cancelled\":false,\"categories\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"gig\"}],\"is_free\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"artists\":[{\"id\":1343,\"artist_name\":\"Crap Stallion\",\"gov_name\":\"\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"bio\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"},{\"id\":1606,\"artist_name\":\"Second Skin\",\"gov_name\":\"\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"bio\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"},{\"id\":2106,\"artist_name\":\"Hearing Tests\",\"gov_name\":\"\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"bio\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"},{\"id\":2107,\"artist_name\":\"[Brick]\",\"gov_name\":\"\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"bio\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"}],\"venues\":[{\"id\":65,\"name\":\"New Cross Inn\",\"address\":\"323 New Cross Road\",\"city\":\"London\",\"country\":\"\",\"capacity\":0,\"contact_email\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"wheelchair_accessible\":false,\"accessible_bathrooms\":false,\"hearing_loop\":false,\"accessible_parking\":false,\"lift_access\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"}],\"promoters\":[{\"id\":94,\"name\":\"Real Life Presents\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"stripe_account_id\":\"\",\"ticket_email\":\"\",\"custom_domain\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"}],\"tags\":[{\"id\":68,\"name\":\"hardcore\"},{\"id\":69,\"name\":\"punk\"},{\"id\":70,\"name\":\"crust punk\"},{\"id\":73,\"name\":\"South London\"},{\"id\":227,\"name\":\"trans solidarity\"},{\"id\":419,\"name\":\"hardcore punk\"},{\"id\":468,\"name\":\"anti-fascism\"}]},{\"id\":760,\"name\":\"VENT ⓥ Valentina Magaletti \\u0026 YPY, Ben Vince\",\"start_time\":\"2026-09-02T19:30:00Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-09-02T22:30:00Z\",\"poster\":\"f812ca6be6b6bc0972979613d7cd2be5.webp\",\"background\":\"\",\"description\":\"Valentina Magaletti \\u0026 YPY (the solo moniker of Japanese musician Koshiro Hino) form an acclaimed experimental, electroacoustic duo. Their collaborative project blends Magaletti's highly percussive, avant-garde drumming with YPY's metallic, handcrafted electronics and polyrhythmic structures, highlighted by their acclaimed LP Kansai Bruises\\n\\nBen Vince is a striking composer and performer, known for his live improvised saxophone explorations and inventive techniques in creating new rhythms, textures and moods. Through live improvisation, sonic manipulation, reprocessing and looping, whether in the studio or on the stage, his spontaneous yet intuitive approach and collaborative nature surpasses the seeming limitations of his primary instrument.\",\"is_featured\":false,\"poster_small\":\"\",\"is_preview\":false,\"external_url\":\"https://ra.co/events/2474351\",\"is_announced\":true,\"is_on_listings_site\":true,\"resale_queue_enabled\":true,\"is_test_event\":false,\"is_cancelled\":false,\"categories\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"gig\"}],\"is_free\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"artists\":[{\"id\":106,\"artist_name\":\"Ben Vince\",\"gov_name\":\"\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"bio\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"},{\"id\":115,\"artist_name\":\"Valentina Magaletti\",\"gov_name\":\"\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"bio\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"},{\"id\":1959,\"artist_name\":\"YPY\",\"gov_name\":\"\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"bio\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"}],\"venues\":[{\"id\":84,\"name\":\"Venue MOT\",\"address\":\"Orion Business Centre, Surrey Canal Rd\",\"city\":\"London\",\"country\":\"\",\"capacity\":0,\"contact_email\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"wheelchair_accessible\":false,\"accessible_bathrooms\":false,\"hearing_loop\":false,\"accessible_parking\":false,\"lift_access\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"}],\"promoters\":[{\"id\":368,\"name\":\"VENT\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"stripe_account_id\":\"\",\"ticket_email\":\"\",\"custom_domain\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"}],\"tags\":[{\"id\":3,\"name\":\"improv\"},{\"id\":8,\"name\":\"experimental\"},{\"id\":40,\"name\":\"electroacoustic\"},{\"id\":541,\"name\":\"percussion\"},{\"id\":542,\"name\":\"drums\"}]},{\"id\":892,\"name\":\" Britney issue no 1: Toxic by Taylor Le Melle launch event with MayDay and BOOKS\",\"start_time\":\"2026-09-03T19:00:00Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-09-03T22:00:00Z\",\"poster\":\"613b8f2445e1c0c3f0f3b9653c1a7837.webp\",\"background\":\"\",\"description\":\"\\nHosted by MayDay in collaboration with BOOKS Peckham. A reading from Taylor Le Melle followed by in conversation with britney editors Kate Paul and Carle Gent. Plus refreshments. Plus karaoke.\\n\\nCome celebrate the launch of the hottest journal of art and new writing to launch this summer. britney is a journal of new art and writing, edited by Carle Gent and Kate Paul. A new artist/writer/clinician/mystic is commissioned for each issue, and each issue is named for a song by the inimitable Britney Spears. britney #1 is Toxic, by writer Taylor Le Melle. It is a science fiction that deals in architectures, bodily inheritances, bio hacking, academia, and double consciousness.\",\"is_featured\":false,\"poster_small\":\"\",\"is_preview\":false,\"external_url\":\"https://events.maydayrooms.org/e/100/britney-issue-no-1-toxic-by-taylor-le-melle\",\"is_announced\":true,\"is_on_listings_site\":true,\"resale_queue_enabled\":true,\"is_test_event\":false,\"is_cancelled\":false,\"is_free\":true,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"venues\":[{\"id\":125,\"name\":\"May Day Rooms\",\"address\":\"88 Fleet Street\",\"city\":\"London\",\"country\":\"\",\"capacity\":0,\"contact_email\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"wheelchair_accessible\":false,\"accessible_bathrooms\":false,\"hearing_loop\":false,\"accessible_parking\":false,\"lift_access\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"}],\"tags\":[{\"id\":107,\"name\":\"magazine launch\"},{\"id\":627,\"name\":\"new art\"}]},{\"id\":677,\"name\":\"Roots On The Corner #44. Shere Khan Sound System meets Jah Messenjah Sound System\",\"start_time\":\"2026-09-04T22:00:00Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-09-05T05:00:00Z\",\"poster\":\"403421ce5c6f6af8c85402e4f574f7f7.webp\",\"background\":\"\",\"description\":\"Roots on the Corner No 44.\\nFriday 4th September 2026!\\n\\nJust when you thought your summer was dun, Roots on the Corner steps back with a deep and heavy start to our winter line up!\\n\\nJah MessenJah sound system (Swindon) “Playing JAH music inna king David style” meets resident sound Shere Khan sound system featuring The Jungle cat, Juno and Ras Terry Gad (London).\\n\\nExpect a deep and spiritually immersive session in Reggae, Dub-wise, Roots and Steppas (Dub Techno) with healing bass pressures, from two unique emerging sound systems.\\n\\nDoors open 10pm - 5am. Last Entry 3am. Nearest tube: Tottenham hale.\\nVenue: Distillery N17, Unit 25, Mill Mead Rd, London N17 9QU, UK\\nHome of Pirates Grog Rum.\\n\\nTickets: £5 / £8 / £11 / £15.\\n\\nExpect the usual giveaways and good vibes and we'll see you at the bar getting those Rum punches! Looking forward to skankin with ya!\\n\\nPlease bring ID, over 18\\\"s only.\\nCASH \\u0026 CARDS accepted.\\n(Online Ticket sales close 11am 4th September.)\",\"is_featured\":false,\"poster_small\":\"\",\"is_preview\":false,\"external_url\":\"https://ra.co/events/2442995\",\"is_announced\":true,\"is_on_listings_site\":true,\"resale_queue_enabled\":true,\"is_test_event\":false,\"is_cancelled\":false,\"categories\":[{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"club\"}],\"is_free\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"artists\":[{\"id\":1772,\"artist_name\":\"Shere Khan Sound System\",\"gov_name\":\"\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"bio\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"},{\"id\":1773,\"artist_name\":\"Jah Messenjah Sound System\",\"gov_name\":\"\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"bio\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"}],\"venues\":[{\"id\":123,\"name\":\"Distillery N17\",\"address\":\"Unit 25 Mill Mead Road\",\"city\":\"London\",\"country\":\"\",\"capacity\":0,\"contact_email\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"wheelchair_accessible\":false,\"accessible_bathrooms\":false,\"hearing_loop\":false,\"accessible_parking\":false,\"lift_access\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"}],\"promoters\":[{\"id\":176,\"name\":\"Roots On The Corner\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"stripe_account_id\":\"\",\"ticket_email\":\"\",\"custom_domain\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"}],\"tags\":[{\"id\":4,\"name\":\"dub\"},{\"id\":5,\"name\":\"reggae\"},{\"id\":6,\"name\":\"sound system\"},{\"id\":201,\"name\":\"roots\"}]},{\"id\":858,\"name\":\"Tufan ~ Closing Party ☆\",\"start_time\":\"2026-09-05T15:00:00Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-09-06T03:00:00Z\",\"poster\":\"3eecd5307f3644a89795b96c79f17723.webp\",\"background\":\"\",\"description\":\"To celebrate the ending of Tufan and Oitij-jo’s participation in Backyard Biennial: East, we are throwing the official big 12 hour closing party! \\n\\nFeaturing Art, Films, Zines, Workshop, DJs + Open Decks (BRING YOUR USB)!\\n\\nLineup: \\n\\nKhan-Ki featuring Alex Neon\\nMisbah\\nAmena Zaman\\nbkonsmoke (Ace.RGB B2B M4ria B2B frostfight000)\\n\\n3pm - 5pm ~ Film Screenings\\n\\n5pm - 7pm ~ T-Shirt Printing Workshop\\n\\n7pm - 8pm ~ Open Decks\\n\\n8pm - 3am ~ DJs\\n\\n9pm ~ Artwork Sales End\\n\\n+ More information about the programme to be announced…\\n\",\"is_featured\":false,\"poster_small\":\"\",\"is_preview\":false,\"external_url\":\"\",\"is_announced\":true,\"is_on_listings_site\":true,\"resale_queue_enabled\":true,\"is_test_event\":false,\"is_cancelled\":false,\"categories\":[{\"id\":5,\"name\":\"film\"},{\"id\":9,\"name\":\"workshop\"}],\"is_free\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"venues\":[{\"id\":156,\"name\":\"Oitij-jo Arts Space\",\"address\":\"Unit 3, Lighterman House, 3 Clove Crescent \",\"city\":\"London\",\"country\":\"United Kingdom\",\"capacity\":0,\"contact_email\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"wheelchair_accessible\":false,\"accessible_bathrooms\":false,\"hearing_loop\":false,\"accessible_parking\":false,\"lift_access\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"}],\"promoters\":[{\"id\":255,\"name\":\"Oitij-jo\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"stripe_account_id\":\"\",\"ticket_email\":\"\",\"custom_domain\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"}],\"ticket_tiers\":[{\"id\":761,\"name\":\"Early bird (Workshop Entry)\",\"description\":\"Entry for the workshop until 8pm only.\",\"price\":10,\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"quantity_available\":20,\"quantity_sold\":0