 from Welsh producers Tomos, IFAND and Ani Glass.\",\"is_featured\":false,\"poster_small\":\"\",\"is_preview\":false,\"external_url\":\"https://link.dice.fm/r0b8d6173ad0\",\"is_announced\":true,\"is_on_listings_site\":true,\"resale_queue_enabled\":true,\"is_test_event\":false,\"is_cancelled\":false,\"categories\":[{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"club\"},{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"gig\"}],\"is_free\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"artists\":[{\"id\":2253,\"artist_name\":\"Tokomololo\",\"gov_name\":\"\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"bio\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"},{\"id\":2254,\"artist_name\":\"SHINOBii\",\"gov_name\":\"\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"bio\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"},{\"id\":2255,\"artist_name\":\"Tomos\",\"gov_name\":\"\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"bio\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"},{\"id\":2256,\"artist_name\":\"IFAND\",\"gov_name\":\"\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"bio\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"},{\"id\":2257,\"artist_name\":\"Ani Glass\",\"gov_name\":\"\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"bio\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"}],\"venues\":[{\"id\":238,\"name\":\"Next Door Records Two\",\"address\":\"\",\"capacity\":0,\"contact_email\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"wheelchair_accessible\":false,\"accessible_bathrooms\":false,\"hearing_loop\":false,\"accessible_parking\":false,\"lift_access\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"}],\"promoters\":[{\"id\":401,\"name\":\"Klust Music\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"stripe_account_id\":\"\",\"ticket_email\":\"\",\"custom_domain\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"}]},{\"id\":714,\"name\":\"People Drift with RRRKRTA\",\"start_time\":\"2026-09-18T22:00:00Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-09-19T03:00:00Z\",\"poster\":\"eaeb58a2db703dcf19fc667598082b18.webp\",\"background\":\"\",\"description\":\"On September 18th 2026, People Drift is delighted to invite RRRKRTA (clinging vine, hard wax) to Spanners for an all-night session along with DJJJ (people drift).\",\"is_featured\":false,\"poster_small\":\"\",\"is_preview\":false,\"external_url\":\"https://ra.co/events/2484575\",\"is_announced\":true,\"is_on_listings_site\":true,\"resale_queue_enabled\":true,\"is_test_event\":false,\"is_cancelled\":false,\"categories\":[{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"club\"}],\"is_free\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"artists\":[{\"id\":2083,\"artist_name\":\"rrrkrta\",\"gov_name\":\"\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"bio\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"},{\"id\":2084,\"artist_name\":\"djjj\",\"gov_name\":\"\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"bio\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"}],\"venues\":[{\"id\":3,\"name\":\"Spanners\",\"address\":\"Arch 504, Ridgway Rd\",\"city\":\"London\",\"country\":\"U.K.\",\"capacity\":0,\"contact_email\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"wheelchair_accessible\":false,\"accessible_bathrooms\":false,\"hearing_loop\":false,\"accessible_parking\":false,\"lift_access\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"}],\"promoters\":[{\"id\":352,\"name\":\"People Drift\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"stripe_account_id\":\"\",\"ticket_email\":\"\",\"custom_domain\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"}],\"tags\":[{\"id\":4,\"name\":\"dub\"},{\"id\":9,\"name\":\"house\"},{\"id\":10,\"name\":\"techno\"},{\"id\":110,\"name\":\"acid\"},{\"id\":492,\"name\":\"#psychedelic\"},{\"id\":493,\"name\":\"#spanners\"},{\"id\":570,\"name\":\"RRRKRTA\"},{\"id\":571,\"name\":\"clinging vine\"},{\"id\":572,\"name\":\"people drift\"},{\"id\":573,\"name\":\"lofi\"},{\"id\":574,\"name\":\"non-dogmatic\"},{\"id\":575,\"name\":\"djjj\"},{\"id\":576,\"name\":\"jim janco\"},{\"id\":581,\"name\":\"12bit\"},{\"id\":582,\"name\":\"aliasing\"}]},{\"id\":766,\"name\":\"HAKEEM (+ Q\\u0026A and Acoustic Set)\",\"start_time\":\"2026-09-19T18:30:00Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-09-19T23:00:00Z\",\"poster\":\"2e75f1c70b49ea91f8ea5e006985a807.webp\",\"background\":\"\",\"description\":\"Doc’n Roll is delighted to be part of The Music is Black Festival from East Bank and to bring a special event to the Rio Cinema celebrating one of London’s most distinctive contemporary musicians, Hak Baker. \\n\\nThe evening will include a special screening of Hakeem, live Q\\u0026A, and an intimate acoustic performance by Hak Baker, offering audiences a unique opportunity to hear directly from Hak about his journey, creative process, and the experiences that have shaped his career. \\n\\nHak’s story is one of resilience, creativity, and community, making him an inspiring figure for a new generation of artists and music fans alike. \\n\\nSynopsis \\nAn unconventional music documentary for a very unconventional musician, this film follows British singer and rapper Hak Baker over five years. Directed by the filmmaking duo of DEADHORSES (James Topley and Ivo Beckett), Hakeem balances profundity and profanity as Baker confronts the traumas of class and masculinity in the wake of his sudden stardom. An anarchic yet sincere portrait of British lad culture, full of arresting aesthetics and savage honesty, this is more than a chronicle of a musician's life – it’s a fascinating and intimate portrait of existential angst, brotherhood and hope in the face of the taboos that surround male mental health.\\n\\nThe Music is Black Festival from East Bank at Queen Elizabeth Olympic Park is a celebration of Black British music across a full programme of events including four live festival weekends. Led by the artists, creators and collectives who built its legacy and shape what’s next, this is where sound lives and culture moves.\",\"is_featured\":false,\"poster_small\":\"\",\"is_preview\":false,\"external_url\":\"https://riocinema.org.uk/Rio.dll/WhatsOn?f=2652932\",\"is_announced\":true,\"is_on_listings_site\":true,\"resale_queue_enabled\":true,\"is_test_event\":false,\"is_cancelled\":false,\"categories\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"gig\"},{\"id\":5,\"name\":\"film\"}],\"is_free\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"artists\":[{\"id\":1969,\"artist_name\":\"Hakeem\",\"gov_name\":\"\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"bio\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"}],\"venues\":[{\"id\":37,\"name\":\"Rio Cinema\",\"address\":\"107 Kingsland High Street\",\"city\":\"London\",\"capacity\":0,\"contact_email\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"wheelchair_accessible\":false,\"accessible_bathrooms\":false,\"hearing_loop\":false,\"accessible_parking\":false,\"lift_access\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"}]},{\"id\":746,\"name\":\"Sullow \\u0026 Resonant Bodies | David Sappa\",\"start_time\":\"2026-09-19T19:30:00Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-09-19T23:00:00Z\",\"poster\":\"1ed6f4e73226f8d37e825b0ee49ec2c4.webp\",\"background\":\"\",\"description\":\"Sullow are an improvising trio featuring Jacken Elswyth, Daniel S. Evans, and Joshua Barfoot of Shovel Dance Collective. Inflected and informed by the traditional music they mutate within the larger group, they negotiate an improvisation that has been variably described as ‘farmyard’ and ‘rodeo’. By turns scrabbling and sweeping, passing motifs rise and fall in quick attacks, short decays and dense bursts of momentary composition.\\n\\nResonant Bodies is a duo comprising Rob Bentall (nyckelharpa) and Zebedee Budworth (hammered dulcimer), who met playing in processional folk-horror ensemble Slug Milk sometime in 2017. They also now also help to coordinate the minimalist free-folk project Emergence Collective. As a duo they seek routes into a free-flowing, improvised folk music via the raw, tonal harmonies of their ancient instruments.\\n\\nLast autumn Resonant Bodies, Jacken, and Josh played a mini-tour together and spent a day recording an album soon to be released as part of the Unfiter series. For this micro-tour a full-strength Sullow and Resonant Bodies will perform together, to explore the tensions and affinities between their contrasting approaches to free-folk. \\n\\n--\\n\\nDavid Sappa is an experimental musician working through kinetic sound objects \\u0026 improvisational environments, field recording + extended listening practices\\n\\nThey’re interested in sound for its tactile, textural and somatic qualities, and as modes for interrelatedness and interplay that can explore dynamics between our social, psychological and material entanglements within different environments.\",\"is_featured\":false,\"poster_small\":\"\",\"is_preview\":false,\"external_url\":\"\",\"is_announced\":true,\"is_on_listings_site\":true,\"resale_queue_enabled\":true,\"is_test_event\":false,\"is_cancelled\":false,\"categories\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"gig\"}],\"is_free\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"artists\":[{\"id\":1412,\"artist_name\":\"David Sappa\",\"gov_name\":\"\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"bio\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"},{\"id\":1924,\"artist_name\":\"Sullow\",\"gov_name\":\"\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"bio\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"},{\"id\":1925,\"artist_name\":\"Resonant Bodies\",\"gov_name\":\"\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"bio\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"}],\"venues\":[{\"id\":17,\"name\":\"The Horse Hospital\",\"address\":\"Colonnade\",\"city\":\"London\",\"country\":\"\",\"capacity\":0,\"contact_email\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"wheelchair_accessible\":false,\"accessible_bathrooms\":false,\"hearing_loop\":false,\"accessible_parking\":false,\"lift_access\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"}],\"promoters\":[{\"id\":136,\"name\":\"The Horse Hospital\",\"contact_email\":\"\",\"stripe_account_id\":\"\",\"ticket_email\":\"\",\"custom_domain\":\"\",\"on_listings_site\":false,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"}],\"ticket_tiers\":[{\"id\":655,\"name\":\"General Admission\",\"price\":12,\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"quantity_available\":100,\"quantity_sold\":5,\"resale_listed_count\":0,\"hidden\":false,\"password_protected\":false,\"is_pwyc\":false,\"is_free\":false,\"resale_enabled\":true,\"resale_when_event_sold_out\":false,\"sort_order\":0,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"},{\"id\":656,\"name\":\"Solidarity\",\"price\":14,\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"quantity_available\":100,\"quantity_sold\":0,\"resale_listed_count\":0,\"hidden\":false,\"password_protected\":false,\"is_pwyc\":false,\"is_free\":false,\"resale_enabled\":true,\"resale_when_event_sold_out\":false,\"sort_order\":0,\"date_created\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"date_updated\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\"},{\"id\":657,\"name\":\"Unwaged / Student\",\"price\":10,\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"quantity_available\":20,\"quantity_sold\":3,\"resale_listed_count\":0,\"hidden\":false,\"password_prote